---
---

<section id="about" class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-16 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-30">
    <div class="absolute top-10 right-0 w-72 h-72 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply blur-3xl" style="background-color: rgba(245, 166, 35, 0.2);"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-20 w-96 h-96 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply blur-3xl" style="background-color: rgba(0, 181, 173, 0.15);"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <div class="mb-16 sm:mb-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6" style="color: var(--color-dark);">
        About <span class="glow-text">Me</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="w-20 h-1 mx-auto rounded-full" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-teal), var(--color-orange));"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
      <div class="cellular-card p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 glow-text-teal">Who I Am</h3>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: var(--color-dark); opacity: 0.9;">
          I'm a passionate software engineer with expertise spanning AI, XR, and backend systems. With 5+ years of experience building scalable applications, I specialize in bridging cutting-edge technology and practical user needs.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-dark); opacity: 0.85;">
          My approach combines rigorous engineering with creative problem-solving, always with an eye toward performance, maintainability, and UX.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cellular-card p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 glow-text-teal">My Focus</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1 text-sm font-bold" style="background: var(--color-teal); color: var(--color-light);">✓</span>
            <span style="color: var(--color-dark); opacity: 0.9;"><strong>AI/ML Systems</strong> - LLM integration, neural networks, optimization</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1 text-sm font-bold" style="background: var(--color-orange); color: var(--color-light);">✓</span>
            <span style="color: var(--color-dark); opacity: 0.9;"><strong>XR Development</strong> - AR/VR applications, spatial computing, OpenXR</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1 text-sm font-bold" style="background: var(--color-teal); color: var(--color-light);">✓</span>
            <span style="color: var(--color-dark); opacity: 0.9;"><strong>Backend Architecture</strong> - Microservices, databases, system design</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cellular-card p-10 sm:p-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-10 glow-text-teal">Technical Stack</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="skill-badge">Python</div>
        <div class="skill-badge">Java</div>
        <div class="skill-badge">TypeScript</div>
        <div class="skill-badge">C#/Unity</div>
        <div class="skill-badge">React</div>
        <div class="skill-badge">Spring Boot</div>
        <div class="skill-badge">PostgreSQL</div>
        <div class="skill-badge">Kubernetes</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .skill-badge {
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-cell-border);
    color: var(--color-dark);
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 181, 173, 0.05) 0%, rgba(245, 166, 35, 0.05) 100%);
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .skill-badge:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 181, 173, 0.15) 0%, rgba(245, 166, 35, 0.15) 100%);
    border-color: var(--color-teal);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 181, 173, 0.2), inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 181, 173, 0.05);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .skill-badge::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: -100%;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(0, 181, 173, 0.2), transparent);
    transition: left 0.5s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .skill-badge:hover::before {
    left: 100%;
  }
</style>
